    "chunk_text": "ene gedon w\u00e6ron, & \u00de\u00e6t se ylca papa Gregorius sende Agustino pallium & maran fultum Godes word to l\u00e6ranne. \u00d0\u00e6t he se papa \u00c6\u00f0elbyrhte \u00feam cyninge gewrit & gyfe sende: \u00fe\u00e6tte Agustinus Cristes cyrican \u00d0\u00e6t Agustinus Cristes cyrican geedniwode & worhte mid \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges fultume \u00c6\u00f0elbyrhtes. \u00d0\u00e6tte Agustinus \u00fe\u00e6t mynster \u00feara apostola Petrus & Paulus getimbrade; & be his \u00feam \u00e6restan \u00d0\u00e6tte \u00c6\u00f0elfri\u00f0 Nor\u00f0anhymbra cyning Scotta \u00feeode mid gefeohte ofercom, & hi of Angel\u00f0eode Her enda\u00f0 seo forme boc. Her onginne\u00f0 seo o\u00f0er boc. Be for\u00f0fore \u00fe\u00e6s eadigan papan Gregorius. \u00d0\u00e6t Agustinus Brytta biscopas for rihtgeleaffulre sibbe l\u00e6rde & monade, ge eac gedonum beforan \u00de\u00e6t he Agustinus Mellitum & Iustum to biscopum gehalgode: & be his for\u00f0fore. \u00d0\u00e6t Laurentius mid his efenbiscopum Scottas w\u00e6s manigende on \u00f0a annysse \u00f0\u00e6re halgan cyrican, For\u00f0ferendum \u00feam cyningum \u00c6\u00f0elbyrhto & S\u00e6byrhto, heora \u00e6fterfyligendas w\u00e6ron deofolgylde \u00d0\u00e6tte Laurentius se arcebiscop w\u00e6s ge\u00feread fram \u00feam apostole Sancte Petre; Eadbaldum \u00feone \u00de\u00e6t Mellitus \u00e6fter Laurentio arcebiscop geworden w\u00e6s. \u00dea ligeas his byrnendre ceastre gebiddende adw\u00e6scte. Be cynedome Eadwines; & \u00fe\u00e6t cumende Paulinus him godspell bodade, & \u00e6rest his dohtor mid \u00d0\u00e6t",
